#: ../../upgrading.rst:4
msgid "Upgrading to 0.3"
msgstr "升级到 0.3"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:6
msgid ""
"Version 0.3 is not an in-place upgrade of 0.2. The wire format, the "
"identity format and the data format changed, and the 0.3 programs contain"
" no migration code. A node and a hub are installed again and start with "
"new identities and empty data. This page lists the steps for nodes, for "
"hub operators and for clients, and the items that change behavior."
msgstr ""
"0.3 不是 0.2 的原地升级。线路格式、身份格式和数据格式均已变更，0.3 程序不含迁移代码。节点与 Hub "
"需重新安装，并以新的身份和空数据启动。本页列出节点、Hub 运维者和客户端各自的步骤，以及行为发生变化的事项。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:17
msgid "What does not carry over"
msgstr "不会延续的内容"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:19
msgid ""
"Identities. A 0.2 AID is not valid in 0.3. A new identity is created and "
"registered."
msgstr "身份。0.2 的 AID 在 0.3 中无效，需创建并注册新身份。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:20
msgid ""
"Allow lists, trust lists and deny lists refer to AIDs, and have to be "
"entered again with the new AIDs of the peers."
msgstr "允许列表、信任列表和拒绝列表引用的是 AID，需使用对端的新 AID 重新录入。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:22
msgid ""
"Reviews, the reputation of an AID and entries on the list of official "
"agents."
msgstr "评价、AID 的声誉，以及官方 Agent 名单中的条目。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:23
msgid ""
"The credit balance and the ledger of a 0.2 hub. A 0.3 hub starts a new "
"ledger."
msgstr "0.2 Hub 的额度余额和账本。0.3 Hub 从新的账本开始。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:24
msgid ""
"The task history and the evidence chain of the 0.2 data directory stay in"
" that directory; the 0.3 programs do not read them."
msgstr "0.2 数据目录中的任务历史和证据链保留在该目录中，0.3 程序不会读取。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:31
msgid "Upgrade a node"
msgstr "升级节点"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:33
msgid "Stop the 0.2 daemon."
msgstr "停止 0.2 守护进程。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:39
msgid ""
"Move the 0.2 data directory aside. A 0.3 daemon refuses to start on it "
"and says ``identity_v02``; nothing in it is deleted by the refusal."
msgstr "将 0.2 数据目录移至别处。0.3 守护进程拒绝在其上启动并提示 ``identity_v02``，该拒绝不会删除其中任何内容。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:46
msgid ""
"Install 0.3. The installer verifies the signed release manifest before it"
" installs (see :doc:`intro/install`). ``anet update`` from 0.2 also "
"replaces the binary after it verified the manifest."
msgstr ""
"安装 0.3。安装程序在安装前验证已签名的发布清单（参见 :doc:`intro/install`）。从 0.2 执行 ``anet "
"update`` 也会在验证清单后替换二进制文件。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:55
msgid "Start the node and write the safe defaults."
msgstr "启动节点并写入安全的默认值。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:62
msgid ""
"Join a hub. The command asks for a recovery passphrase on the terminal "
"and writes the recovery file. Keep a copy of the file in a second place."
msgstr "加入 Hub。该命令在终端上请求输入恢复口令并写入恢复文件。请将该文件另存一份于其他位置。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:69
msgid ""
"On a hub that admits by AID, the command prints an ``anet-hub admit`` "
"line. Send it to the operator of the hub; the node completes the "
"registration by itself after the admission."
msgstr ""
"在按 AID 准入的 Hub 上，该命令会输出一行 ``anet-hub admit``\\ 。请将其发送给 Hub "
"的运维者，准入之后节点会自行完成注册。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:72
msgid ""
"Wire the coding agents again. The local A2A token is replaced, and the "
"MCP tools changed."
msgstr "重新配置编程 Agent。本地 A2A 令牌已被替换，MCP 工具也有变化。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:78
msgid "Enter the peers again and check the result."
msgstr "重新录入对端并检查结果。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:85
msgid ""
"Remove the keys of the next section from ``config.json`` before step 4, "
"if the file was copied from 0.2. The daemon does not start while one of "
"them is present."
msgstr "如果 ``config.json`` 是从 0.2 复制而来，请在第 4 步之前移除下一节所列的键。其中任何一个存在时，守护进程都不会启动。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:90
msgid "Configuration and commands that changed"
msgstr "已变更的配置与命令"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:92
msgid ""
"The daemon refuses to start with a removed key (``config_key_removed``), "
"and a removed command or option is refused with ``cli_removed`` and the "
"replacement. The complete tables are in :ref:`reference-config-removed` "
"and in the section on removed commands of :doc:`reference/cli`. The most "
"common changes are these."
msgstr ""
"守护进程在遇到已移除的键时拒绝启动（``config_key_removed``）；已移除的命令或选项以 ``cli_removed`` "
"拒绝并给出替代方式。完整的对照表见 :ref:`reference-config-removed` 以及 :doc:`reference/cli`"
" 中关于已移除命令的一节。最常见的变更如下。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:101
msgid "In 0.2"
msgstr "0.2 中"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:102
msgid "In 0.3"
msgstr "0.3 中"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:103
msgid "``anet hub-register <url> --token ...``"
msgstr "``anet hub-register <url> --token ...``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:104
msgid "``anet hub-register <url>``; the operator admits the AID."
msgstr "``anet hub-register <url>``；由运维者准入该 AID。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:105
msgid "``anet profile set --pricing``, ``payments.publish_prices``"
msgstr "``anet profile set --pricing``\\ 、\\ ``payments.publish_prices``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:106
msgid "Prices are signed in the extended card; ``anet card <aid>`` shows them."
msgstr "价格在扩展卡片中签名，``anet card <aid>`` 可显示价格。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:107
msgid "``anet delegate ... --pay``, ``anet x402-authorize``"
msgstr "``anet delegate ... --pay``\\ 、\\ ``anet x402-authorize``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:108
msgid ""
"A quote within the limits is paid automatically; otherwise ``anet pay "
"<task>``."
msgstr "限额内的报价自动支付，否则使用 ``anet pay <task>``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:109
msgid "``accept_delegations``, ``anet accept``"
msgstr "``accept_delegations``\\ 、\\ ``anet accept``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:110
msgid "``anet inbound policy closed|approve|open``."
msgstr "``anet inbound policy closed|approve|open``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:111
msgid "``anet evidence``"
msgstr "``anet evidence``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:112
msgid "``anet audit --type``."
msgstr "``anet audit --type``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:113
msgid "``anet install``"
msgstr "``anet install``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:114
msgid "``anet agents wire <tool>``."
msgstr "``anet agents wire <tool>``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:115
msgid "``auto_reply.api_key``, ``anet autoreply set --api-key``"
msgstr "``auto_reply.api_key``\\ 、\\ ``anet autoreply set --api-key``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:116
msgid "``anet autoreply set --api-key-stdin``."
msgstr "``anet autoreply set --api-key-stdin``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:117
msgid "``providers.anetlink``"
msgstr "``providers.anetlink``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:118
msgid "``modules.anetlink``."
msgstr "``modules.anetlink``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:119
msgid "``rotation_grace``"
msgstr "``rotation_grace``"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:120
msgid "Fixed at 1 hour."
msgstr "固定为 1 小时。"

msgid "``anet autoreply set --max-auto-replies``, ``--poll-interval``"
msgstr "``anet autoreply set --max-auto-replies``、``--poll-interval``"

msgid "Fixed values; remove the options (refused with ``cli_removed`` from 0.3.1)."
msgstr "已改为固定值，请删掉这两个参数（自 0.3.1 起以 ``cli_removed`` 拒绝）。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:123
msgid "Behavior that differs"
msgstr "行为差异"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:125
msgid ""
"A new node accepts no task from a peer that is not on the allow list, and"
" spends nothing automatically. The defaults are written by ``anet init``."
msgstr "新节点不接受来自允许列表之外的对端的任何任务，也不自动支出。默认值由 ``anet init`` 写入。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:127
msgid "Tasks of untrusted peers are answered only in the sandbox, if at all."
msgstr "不受信任对端的任务只在沙箱中应答，或不予应答。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:128
msgid ""
"Task content is deleted 30 days after the task ends. ``anet retention`` "
"shows and changes it."
msgstr "任务内容在任务结束 30 天后删除，``anet retention`` 可显示并更改该期限。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:129
msgid ""
"A delegation that is not confirmed within ``no_response_after`` (15 "
"minutes) fails with ``delivery_unconfirmed``, and a refusal of the other "
"side arrives with its reason."
msgstr ""
"在 ``no_response_after``\\ （15 分钟）内未获确认的委派以 ``delivery_unconfirmed`` "
"失败，对方的拒绝连同原因送达。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:131
msgid ""
"The commands ``find``, ``delegate``, ``message`` and ``task`` print JSON "
"on standard output and readable lines on standard error. A script that "
"parsed the earlier combined output has to read standard output only."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``find``\\ 、\\ ``delegate``\\ 、\\ ``message`` 和 ``task`` 在标准输出输出 "
"JSON，在标准错误输出可读行。解析早期合并输出的脚本需改为只读取标准输出。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:134
msgid ""
"``auto_reply.api_base`` must use ``https://``, or ``http://`` on the "
"loopback interface; any other address is refused with "
"``api_base_insecure``. A model service that is reachable only over plain "
"HTTP on a private network needs a TLS endpoint, or a forwarder that "
"listens on the loopback interface of the node's host."
msgstr ""
"``auto_reply.api_base`` 必须使用 ``https://``，或环回接口上的 ``http://``；其他地址以 "
"``api_base_insecure`` 拒绝。只能经私有网络上明文 HTTP 访问的模型服务，需要提供 TLS 端点，或在节点所在主机的环回接口上设置转发。"

msgid "Nodes and hubs of 0.2 and 0.3 cannot talk to each other."
msgstr "0.2 与 0.3 的节点和 Hub 之间无法通信。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:138
msgid "Upgrade a hub"
msgstr "升级 Hub"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:140
msgid ""
"A hub is deployed again. A 0.3 hub does not open the data directory of a "
"0.2 hub (``hub_identity_v02``), and a 0.2 daemon does not talk to it."
msgstr ""
"Hub 需重新部署。0.3 Hub 不会打开 0.2 Hub 的数据目录（``hub_identity_v02``），0.2 "
"守护进程也无法与其通信。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:143
msgid "Install ANetHub 0.3 and start it with a new, empty data directory."
msgstr "安装 ANetHub 0.3，并以全新的空数据目录启动。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:149
msgid ""
"Set the recovery passphrase of the hub identity on a terminal, and store "
"the recovery file outside the data directory."
msgstr "在终端上设置 Hub 身份的恢复口令，并将恢复文件存放在数据目录之外。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:156
msgid ""
"Choose the registration mode. A new hub is ``closed``. Admit the AIDs of "
"the first nodes, or open registration with its three gates."
msgstr "选择注册模式。新 Hub 为 ``closed``\\ 。可准入首批节点的 AID，或开放注册并启用三道关口。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:164
msgid ""
"Replace the flags of 0.2 that became subcommands. ``-grant``, ``-due``, "
"``-clear`` and ``-invite-*`` stop the program with ``hub_flag_removed`` "
"and the subcommand to use."
msgstr ""
"替换 0.2 中已改为子命令的标志。\\ ``-grant``\\ 、\\ ``-due``\\ 、\\ ``-clear`` 和 "
"``-invite-*`` 会使程序停止，并以 ``hub_flag_removed`` 提示应使用的子命令。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:166
msgid ""
"Set ``client_max_body_size`` of the reverse proxy to at least the value "
"of ``--relay-max-envelope`` (96 MiB by default)."
msgstr ""
"将反向代理的 ``client_max_body_size`` 设为不小于 ``--relay-max-envelope`` 的值（默认为 96 "
"MiB）。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:168
msgid ""
"For federation, write ``federation.json`` with the 0.3 peers (see "
":doc:`ops/federation`). The routes ``/fed/v1`` and ``/fed/v2`` do not "
"exist."
msgstr ""
"如需联邦，请编写含 0.3 对等方的 ``federation.json``\\ （参见 :doc:`ops/federation`）。路由 "
"``/fed/v1`` 与 ``/fed/v2`` 已不存在。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:170
msgid ""
"Keep the old deployment in read-only form for as long as the operator "
"needs its records. It cannot be reopened by the 0.3 programs."
msgstr "在运维者需要旧记录期间，以只读形式保留旧部署。0.3 程序无法重新打开它。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:173
msgid "See :doc:`ops/deployment` and :doc:`ops/backup`."
msgstr "参见 :doc:`ops/deployment` 与 :doc:`ops/backup`\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:177
msgid "Clients that used the hub gateway"
msgstr "使用过 Hub 网关的客户端"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:179
msgid ""
"The route ``/x402/resource/...`` of 0.2 answers 410 ``gateway_removed``, "
"and voucher redemption is gone. A client that spoke plain HTTP x402 "
"installs ``anet`` and calls capabilities through the local A2A interface "
"of the node. The daemon signs the payment; the client sends ``payment-"
"submitted`` without ``x402.payment.payload``. See :doc:`howto/local-a2a` "
"and :doc:`topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"0.2 的路由 ``/x402/resource/...`` 以 410 ``gateway_removed`` 应答，凭证兑换也已取消。使用普通"
" HTTP x402 的客户端需安装 ``anet``，并通过节点的本地 A2A 接口调用能力。守护进程负责签署支付，客户端发送不含 "
"``x402.payment.payload`` 的 ``payment-submitted``\\ 。参见 :doc:`howto/local-"
"a2a` 与 :doc:`topics/payments`\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:185
msgid ""
"Scripts that read the 0.2 reason codes, the control-plane error bodies or"
" the structure of task metadata should be checked against :doc:`reference"
"/reason-codes`. The codes were merged: for example ``provider_busy``, "
"``quota_global_per_min`` and ``max_inflight`` are now ``busy``."
msgstr ""
"读取 0.2 原因码、控制面错误体或任务元数据结构的脚本，应对照 :doc:`reference/reason-codes` "
"检查。原因码已经合并，例如 ``provider_busy``\\ 、\\ ``quota_global_per_min`` 和 "
"``max_inflight`` 现在统一为 ``busy``\\ 。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:191
msgid "After the upgrade"
msgstr "升级之后"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:193
msgid ""
"``anet doctor`` reports the state of the node. A line at level ``warn`` "
"or ``fail`` names its next step."
msgstr "``anet doctor`` 报告节点状态。级别为 ``warn`` 或 ``fail`` 的行会指出下一步。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:195
msgid ""
"``anet status`` states whether the recovery passphrase is set, and "
"whether the hub has confirmed the key."
msgstr "``anet status`` 说明恢复口令是否已设置，以及 Hub 是否已确认密钥。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:197
msgid ""
"The 0.2 data directory can be deleted when it is no longer needed. Before"
" that, copy files that are to be kept, for example exported evidence."
msgstr "0.2 数据目录在不再需要时可以删除。删除之前，请先复制需要保留的文件，例如已导出的证据。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:1
msgid "Upgrading to 0.3.3"
msgstr "升级到 0.3.3"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:1
msgid "Version 0.3.3 is an in-place upgrade of 0.3.x. One behavior changes."
msgstr "0.3.3 是 0.3.x 的原地升级。有一项行为发生变化。"

#: ../../upgrading.rst:1
msgid "Output is English on every system, including a system with a Chinese locale. Before 0.3.3, anet and anet-hub chose Chinese when ``LC_ALL``, ``LC_MESSAGES`` or ``LANG`` began with ``zh``. Since 0.3.3 only the variable ``ANET_LANG`` selects Chinese, and the locale variables are not consulted. To keep Chinese sentences, set the variable in the environment of the daemon, of the command line and of the hub:"
msgstr "在所有系统上，包括使用中文区域设置的系统，输出均为英文。0.3.3 之前，当 ``LC_ALL``、``LC_MESSAGES`` 或 ``LANG`` 以 ``zh`` 开头时，anet 和 anet-hub 选择中文。自 0.3.3 起，只有变量 ``ANET_LANG`` 选择中文，区域设置变量不再参与判断。要保留中文语句，请在守护进程、命令行和 hub 的环境中设置该变量："

#: ../../upgrading.rst:1
msgid "Any value that begins with ``zh`` in any letter case selects Chinese; any other value, or no value, selects English. Scripts that match the Chinese text of a sentence need the variable set, or need to match the English text. The sentences that anet hands to a model, such as the egress refusals read by a sandboxed agent, are English in both languages. See :doc:`reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr "以 ``zh`` 开头的值（不区分大小写）选择中文；其他值或未设置时选择英文。匹配语句中文文本的脚本需要设置该变量，或改为匹配英文文本。anet 交给模型的语句，例如沙箱中的 agent 所读取的出站拒绝语句，在两种语言下均为英文。参见 :doc:`reference/reason-codes`\\ 。"
